House 3 fronts with 4 bedrooms, garden and terrace in Kain
Located in Kain, this pleasant 3-facade house develops a living area of about 149 m2 on a plot of 270 m 2. Offering beautiful volumes and a family configuration, it will seduce the candidates in search of an immediately habitable property.
On the ground floor, the entrance hall leads to a bright living room of 29 m 2, decorated with a pellet fire bringing warmth and friendliness. You will also discover a large semi-equipped kitchen of 33 m 2, ideal for family meals. A separate toilet completes this level and can easily be converted into a shower room thanks to the arrivals and evacuations already present.
Outside, you will enjoy a fully fenced garden with an excellent southwest orientation, as well as a pleasant terrace of 22 m2 equipped with a pergola. A healthy cellar and a motorcycle box on the facade complete the services.
The first floor consists of two beautiful bedrooms of 12 m2 and 14 m 2, as well as a bathroom equipped with a bathtub with shower function, a sink and a location for washing machine.
The second floor accommodates two additional bedrooms of 11 m2 and 8 m 2.
Technical characteristics
Gas central heating with recent boiler;
Pellet fire in the living room;
Recent double-glazed PVC frames;
Rear roof redone and insulated;
Healthy cellar;
Electricity to be brought into conformity (absence of diagrams);
PEB D, close to category C.
A house with generous volumes, with 4 bedrooms, a pleasant exterior well oriented and many technical advantages, ideal for a family wishing to settle in a popular environment near Tournai and all amenities.
